`COMPLETE`

All mandatory requirements pass.

`PARTIAL`

Feedback or training components exist, but verified data, evaluation, release or monitoring remains incomplete.

`BLOCKED`

Consent, licensing, annotation capacity, compute or another essential dependency prevents valid execution.

